:: Alleyways Capture Rescue
<<effects>>


The lights go out, plunging the room into darkness. A moment later you hear a thud, followed by another. A pair of hands tug at your bindings, removing them. Whoever is responsible wraps a towel around your shoulders, before helping you to your feet.
<br><br>

They take your hand, and lead you from the building.
<br><br>

