:: Alleyways Capture Rescue Victim
<<effects>>

<<loadNPC 0 "alleyways_rescue_victim">><<person1>>
Your eyes adjust to the daylight, and you behold your rescuer. It's the <<person>> you saved. <<Hes>> still bruised and haggard looking, but a fire has returned to <<his>> eyes.
<br><br>

"I'm sorry," <<he>> says. "They should never have caught me. I was careless, passed out, and when I awoke they had me strapped to that table." <<He>> grimaces as an injury troubles <<him>>. "Thank you for finding me."
<br><br>

